Okay, let's see.

1208
01:21:21,450 --> 01:21:21,930
What do we get?

1209
01:21:22,030 --> 01:21:22,370
What do we get?

1210
01:21:28,040 --> 01:21:28,440
Uh...

1211
01:21:28,440 --> 01:21:28,900
Golden items.

1212
01:21:29,560 --> 01:21:31,000
I guess they've been raiding, huh?

1213
01:21:31,980 --> 01:21:32,560
Superior cutlass?

1214
01:21:33,940 --> 01:21:34,580
Melee item?

1215
01:21:37,300 --> 01:21:37,700
Golden...

1216
