Golden platforms, red hat.

1222
01:21:52,100 --> 01:21:53,220
Yeah, alright.

1223
01:21:54,020 --> 01:21:55,460
I guess I got some money out of it.

1224
01:21:56,320 --> 01:21:59,980
And if I ever want a really golden themed place, I can now do that.

1225
01:22:02,900 --> 01:22:03,300
Okay.

1226
01:22:04,640 --> 01:22:05,480
What is next?

1227
01:22:08,440 --> 01:22:08,920
Actually,

1228
01:22:11,990 --> 01:22:13,430
I'm going to give that to Marty.

1229
01:22:17,740 --> 01:22:20,480
