1264
01:23:43,400 --> 01:23:46,380
With a golden sofa and all the golden...

1265
01:23:46,380 --> 01:23:47,900
etchings, you know.

1266
01:23:47,900 --> 01:23:49,140
All the good stuff.

1267
01:23:51,080 --> 01:23:51,480
Like this.

