1277
01:24:10,080 --> 01:24:10,920
It's a weapon.

1278
01:24:11,600 --> 01:24:12,420
It's a melee weapon.

1279
01:24:13,040 --> 01:24:13,640
What a surprise.

1280
01:24:14,580 --> 01:24:15,980
Let's put it in the melee box.

1281
01:24:17,900 --> 01:24:18,520
There you go.

1282
01:24:18,860 --> 01:24:19,780
This one will be sold.

1283
