1288
01:24:31,120 --> 01:24:32,240
Precise or fleeting?

1289
01:24:33,520 --> 01:24:35,840
I think I want to keep the fleeting.

1290
01:24:36,580 --> 01:24:37,060
And then sort.

1291
01:24:37,820 --> 01:24:38,180
There we go.

1292
01:24:39,100 --> 01:24:40,100
