1302
01:25:12,160 --> 01:25:13,220
I couldn't just do it anywhere, right?

1303
01:25:14,460 --> 01:25:15,500
No, I can't do it here.

1304
01:25:16,040 --> 01:25:17,120
I think it needs to be Knight.

1305
