Or maybe I need to go where the old man was.

1306
01:25:21,220 --> 01:25:22,880
No, actually, it needs to be Knight.

1307
01:25:23,220 --> 01:25:24,000
Remember the old man?

1308
01:25:27,110 --> 01:25:28,530
It's got to be something like that.

1309
01:25:30,290 --> 01:25:31,250
