1323
01:26:11,020 --> 01:26:11,960
I have one.

1324
01:26:14,600 --> 01:26:16,360
Shit, I gotta go find some daybloom.

1325
01:26:18,040 --> 01:26:20,600
How about we just go around and collect some flowers for a bit?

1326
01:26:22,860 --> 01:26:24,600
So, daybloom, water and...

1327
01:26:25,900 --> 01:26:27,280
Fuck, I forgot the last thing.

1328
01:26:29,500 --> 01:26:30,280
Oh, lead, lead.

1329
01:26:33,680 --> 01:26:34,180
Or...

1330
01:26:34,900 --> 01:26:35,400
Lead...

1331
01:26:35,400 --> 01:26:36,360
Gimme one.

1332
01:26:37,280 --> 01:26:38,140
There it is, there it is.

1333
01:26:40,080 --> 01:26:41,380
Dum, dum, dum.

1334
01:26:41,740 --> 01:26:42,380
Okay, whoa!

1335
01:26:43,560 --> 01:26:45,820
I had my potion crafting station over here.

1336
01:26:46,600 --> 01:26:46,880
There.

1337
01:26:48,660 --> 01:26:49,360
There you go.

1338
01:26:51,100 --> 01:26:51,500
Nice!

1339
01:26:53,640 --> 01:26:53,880
Quick stack.

1340
01:26:55,940 --> 01:26:56,720
Now I have that.

1341
01:26:59,500 --> 01:27:00,280
Put it in.

1342
01:27:01,140 --> 01:27:01,640
Put it in.

1343
01:27:02,860 --> 01:27:04,080
And potions, put this in.

1344
01:27:04,680 --> 01:27:05,120
Very good.

1345
01:27:05,280 --> 01:27:07,660
Do I have anything else in here I may want to take with me?

1346
01:27:09,180 --> 01:27:10,120
Maybe the regeneration.

1347
01:27:11,460 --> 01:27:13,500
Now, the thing is, I want to leave at least one of them in here.

1348
01:27:14,020 --> 01:27:14,560
One of each.

1349
