That was the point.

1350
01:27:16,540 --> 01:27:19,040
So that I can always click the button and make it auto-sort.

1351
01:27:19,040 --> 01:27:21,800
You know, auto-stack, I mean.

1352
01:27:23,720 --> 01:27:24,960
Heartreach, let's take one of these, I guess.

1353
01:27:25,140 --> 01:27:26,400
