1354
01:27:29,380 --> 01:27:29,720
Gravitation...

1355
01:27:29,720 --> 01:27:30,380
Water...

1356
01:27:30,380 --> 01:27:30,860
Hey!

1357
01:27:32,380 --> 01:27:33,260
I have an idea.

1358
01:27:39,640 --> 01:27:41,760
I could just fight a boss in the water with water walking.

1359
01:27:43,140 --> 01:27:43,920
Wouldn't that be awesome?

1360
01:27:44,880 --> 01:27:45,160
Hello?

1361
01:27:47,820 --> 01:27:49,540
That seems pretty cool, man, I'll take it.

1362
01:27:53,300 --> 01:27:54,280
And I think that's it.

1363
01:27:54,840 --> 01:27:55,480
For now.

1364
01:27:56,960 --> 01:27:57,440
This is good.

1365
01:27:58,740 --> 01:27:59,000
Okay!

1366
01:27:59,640 --> 01:28:00,200
