1369
01:28:08,280 --> 01:28:10,440
The statue here, let's just leave that here, that's actually nice.

1370
01:28:11,620 --> 01:28:13,180
I hate these things with a passion.

1371
01:28:16,060 --> 01:28:17,880
I hate these things with a mild passion.

1372
01:28:18,300 --> 01:28:20,200
A very mild one, it's not bad at all.

1373
01:28:23,120 --> 01:28:24,000
Let's replace...

1374
01:28:24,000 --> 01:28:24,840
Where's my running?

1375
01:28:25,740 --> 01:28:26,200
There we go.

1376
01:28:27,020 --> 01:28:27,540
I need running.

1377
01:28:29,020 --> 01:28:35,880
By the way, I think this defense that I got here, you know the shields that rotate around me, I think they helped me a lot during the last fight.

1378
01:28:36,020 --> 01:28:38,160
I'm not sure they did, but I think they did.

1379
01:28:38,780 --> 01:28:40,720
Because I saw the effect constantly on me.

1380
01:28:41,920 --> 01:28:43,040
And it's got to be good, right?

