3302
03:20:55,040 --> 03:20:59,560
Apparently, it's this great ore that will give you amazing armor, but...

3303
03:20:59,560 --> 03:21:01,280
I've yet to see this amazing armor.

3304
03:21:04,260 --> 03:21:06,620
So far, all I've seen is mediocre armor.

3305
03:21:06,980 --> 03:21:08,360
Actually, it's worse than that.

3306
03:21:09,740 --> 03:21:11,000
Give me the unholy arrow.

3307
03:21:14,160 --> 03:21:15,680
Man, there's so much titanium here.

3308
03:21:26,790 --> 03:21:27,110
Whoops.

3309
03:21:30,470 --> 03:21:31,790
Let me go this way.

3310
03:21:43,620 --> 03:21:47,680
Or maybe it's one of those things where if you explore the entire map, that's when the game really ends, you know?

3311
03:21:49,400 --> 03:21:50,840
It's all about digging in this game.

3312
03:21:52,360 --> 03:21:53,040
Digging, digging, digging.

3313
03:21:55,700 --> 03:21:56,960
It's got to be a boss thing.

3314
03:21:58,960 --> 03:21:59,860
Reaching the credits, right?

3315
03:22:02,020 --> 03:22:03,440
I actually hope it's not.

3316
03:22:06,160 --> 03:22:08,960
I would rather not kill any bosses, honestly.

3317
03:22:09,940 --> 03:22:11,300
I just want to explore these caves.

3318
03:22:14,490 --> 03:22:15,430
No bosses, please.

3319
03:22:16,670 --> 03:22:18,430
Where's my... Oh, I used all my torches!

3320
03:22:18,670 --> 03:22:19,090
Holy shit.

3321
03:22:20,530 --> 03:22:22,050
Let's bring out the normal ones, then.

3322
03:22:23,330 --> 03:22:24,270
Back to normal torches.

3323
03:22:25,430 --> 03:22:26,050
What are you?

3324
03:22:26,790 --> 03:22:27,870
An icy merman.

3325
03:22:33,100 --> 03:22:34,400
You dropped money.

3326
03:22:34,720 --> 03:22:35,880
Everyone has money on them, apparently.

3327
03:22:39,840 --> 03:22:40,160
Oh!

3328
03:22:40,560 --> 03:22:41,420
Didn't mean to fall through that.

3329
03:22:41,880 --> 03:22:42,480
What is that in there?

3330
03:22:44,080 --> 03:22:44,920
It's emerald, right.

3331
03:22:47,910 --> 03:22:48,710
Look at that!

3332
03:22:49,090 --> 03:22:52,670
A shiverthorn just in a single tile, surrounded by ice.

3333
03:22:54,730 --> 03:22:56,490
Life always finds a way.

3334
03:23:02,840 --> 03:23:03,300
Er...

3335
03:23:05,400 --> 03:23:06,400
I want to kill that.

3336
03:23:08,480 --> 03:23:11,000
I want a frost shell.

3337
03:23:15,910 --> 03:23:17,130
Maybe that's not what they drop.

3338
03:23:18,830 --> 03:23:23,490
Speaking of shells, there was something I could make with the tortoise shell, and I got a couple extra.

3339
03:23:25,050 --> 03:23:25,950
I gotta try that.

3340
03:23:27,070 --> 03:23:27,070
Oops.

3341
03:23:27,330 --> 03:23:28,090
It's so slippery here.

3342
03:23:29,830 --> 03:23:31,050
Oh, there's gold in there!

3343
03:23:33,830 --> 03:23:36,010
Not that I really care too much about gold at this point.

3344
03:23:39,330 --> 03:23:41,790
But, you know, when I see it, I'm gonna take it, of course.

3345
03:23:42,510 --> 03:23:42,830
I mean...

3346
03:23:46,570 --> 03:23:47,150
Sup, icy merman?

3347
03:23:49,050 --> 03:23:49,690
Icy elemental?

3348
03:23:51,090 --> 03:23:52,410
Wait, I didn't take the gold.

3349
03:23:54,230 --> 03:23:54,710
There we go.

3350
03:24:00,800 --> 03:24:01,320
Sup, man?

3351
03:24:04,930 --> 03:24:05,350
Dude.

3352
03:24:06,630 --> 03:24:07,710
It's Friday, dammit.

3353
03:24:08,830 --> 03:24:09,790
I just remembered.

3354
03:24:10,810 --> 03:24:14,290
The best feeling when you just remember it, after forgetting it.

3355
03:24:18,370 --> 03:24:20,210
You know what the best thing is, too, in the weekends?

3356
03:24:21,010 --> 03:24:22,090
You said you're a long clock.

3357
03:24:22,870 --> 03:24:23,470
Very early.

3358
03:24:24,490 --> 03:24:27,310
And then you wake up, and you're like, oh fuck, I gotta go to work and all that, right?

3359
03:24:28,310 --> 03:24:29,250
But then, no, you don't!

3360
03:24:29,730 --> 03:24:30,230
Because it's weekend!

3361
03:24:31,170 --> 03:24:32,230
And you can have that every day!

3362
03:24:32,870 --> 03:24:34,850
If you said you're a long clock, really early.

3363
03:24:36,170 --> 03:24:37,370
Little life hack for you there.

3364
03:24:38,870 --> 03:24:39,750
I swear it works.

3365
03:24:43,170 --> 03:24:43,910
What is that?

3366
03:24:44,810 --> 03:24:46,450
Oh, I thought it was like a door thingy.

3367
03:24:47,030 --> 03:24:48,950
Okay, so we are actually getting quite far down.

3368
03:24:50,150 --> 03:24:51,830
We're approaching the underside.

3369
03:24:54,150 --> 03:24:54,510
Oh.

3370
03:24:57,670 --> 03:24:58,570
Giant bad banner?

3371
03:24:58,750 --> 03:25:00,590
Look at this, I have a shit ton of potions.

3372
03:25:02,030 --> 03:25:02,470
Where'd I put them?

3373
03:25:04,890 --> 03:25:07,050
Oh, don't tell me they went into the...

3374
03:25:09,230 --> 03:25:10,010
Wait a minute, what's that?

3375
03:25:11,470 --> 03:25:12,470
Hasty philosopher's stone.

3376
03:25:13,110 --> 03:25:13,550
Yoink!

3377
03:25:14,450 --> 03:25:15,070
That's mine.

3378
03:25:18,230 --> 03:25:18,670
25%.

3379
03:25:18,670 --> 03:25:19,450
Oh yeah, wait a minute!

3380
03:25:19,850 --> 03:25:21,110
This is a material as well!

3381
03:25:22,290 --> 03:25:24,250
I have to try that with Jack.

3382
03:25:25,630 --> 03:25:28,150
I think I did try it once, but there's no way I remember that.

3383
03:25:28,450 --> 03:25:29,950
The combinations here are absurd.

3384
03:25:31,250 --> 03:25:33,250
So, maybe we can do some crazy stuff with that.

3385
03:25:34,230 --> 03:25:35,050
Get out of here!

3386
03:25:40,460 --> 03:25:40,860
Nice.

3387
03:25:44,590 --> 03:25:45,830
Oh, this is actually bad.

3388
03:25:46,530 --> 03:25:47,590
Just let him die in the lava.

3389
03:25:48,750 --> 03:25:49,350
Oh god!

3390
03:25:50,990 --> 03:25:52,170
It's me who's dying in the lava.

3391
03:26:00,290 --> 03:26:01,530
What are we finding down here?

3392
03:26:02,810 --> 03:26:04,770
Look at this, there's ice right next to the lava.

3393
03:26:06,750 --> 03:26:09,790
What a weird little contrast here.

3394
03:26:19,960 --> 03:26:20,760
What do we have here?

3395
03:26:22,980 --> 03:26:23,720
What was that sound?

3396
03:26:27,360 --> 03:26:28,180
Was that you making that sound?

3397
03:26:34,420 --> 03:26:35,140
Sunflower statue.

3398
03:26:38,960 --> 03:26:39,880
Wait a minute, did it go in here?

3399
03:26:39,880 --> 03:26:41,220
It did.

3400
03:26:41,940 --> 03:26:42,540
Let me check something.

3401
03:26:45,850 --> 03:26:46,660
If I now do this...

3402
03:26:52,120 --> 03:26:57,200
I thought for a second maybe this would count as a sunflower as well, but just maybe with more range or something.

3403
03:27:00,020 --> 03:27:01,460
The statues are a little confusing.

3404
03:27:05,210 --> 03:27:08,230
I feel like they work sometimes and other times they don't.

3405
03:27:10,770 --> 03:27:13,070
If I even understand them correctly, that's a big if.

3406
03:27:14,430 --> 03:27:15,730
I think I do, but...

3407
03:27:17,450 --> 03:27:18,090
Probably not.

3408
03:27:22,200 --> 03:27:22,840
This area.

3409
03:27:25,640 --> 03:27:28,160
Okay, so when it's like purple, it always goes in the void ray.

3410
03:27:28,300 --> 03:27:29,160
I have to...

3411
03:27:29,160 --> 03:27:29,980
Void ray...

3412
03:27:29,980 --> 03:27:30,780
I've been playing so much Starcraft.

3413
03:27:31,880 --> 03:27:33,000
It goes into the void bag.

3414
03:27:38,960 --> 03:27:40,160
Look how slow I'm damaging them.

3415
03:27:40,920 --> 03:27:42,620
But when I pee on them, it's like...

3416
03:27:42,620 --> 03:27:44,180
I almost want to say twice as fast.

3417
03:27:44,320 --> 03:27:45,340
Maybe 30% quicker.

3418
03:27:51,620 --> 03:27:53,220
Also, I've been in this spot a million times.

3419
03:27:53,720 --> 03:27:55,400
This is like a very well-known spot to me.

3420
03:27:57,800 --> 03:27:58,440
I think.

3421
03:27:58,840 --> 03:27:59,700
Or maybe they just look alike.

3422
03:28:01,480 --> 03:28:02,480
It's also possible.

3423
03:28:09,270 --> 03:28:10,050
What do we have here?

3424
03:28:12,730 --> 03:28:13,210
Oopsie.

3425
03:28:14,270 --> 03:28:14,510
Archer.

3426
03:28:20,720 --> 03:28:21,180
What's that?

3427
03:28:23,800 --> 03:28:23,880
Lead.

3428
03:28:26,560 --> 03:28:29,920
Of all the ores, lead is actually one of the more useful ones.

3429
03:28:38,240 --> 03:28:39,060
Oh, there you are.

3430
03:28:39,640 --> 03:28:40,180
I heard you.

3431
03:28:47,800 --> 03:28:48,220
Okay.

3432
03:28:50,000 --> 03:28:52,880
I'm going to cut back to the right over here and then go down again.

3433
03:28:53,840 --> 03:28:55,740
See if I can't find this goddamn soul.

3434
03:28:58,220 --> 03:28:59,220
It's got to be somewhere.

3435
03:29:01,220 --> 03:29:03,060
I wonder if it's like a randomized thing.

3436
03:29:05,200 --> 03:29:10,920
Like every time I go back down to the underworld, there's like a different spot this guy could appear in.

3437
03:29:10,960 --> 03:29:16,240
Or if it's like preset from the moment the world was generated or something, you know.

3438
03:29:17,640 --> 03:29:19,600
I'm assuming it's the first option there.

3439
03:29:23,510 --> 03:29:28,110
Because everything seems a little random like that so far.

3440
03:29:29,710 --> 03:29:30,670
Okay, then we go down.

3441
03:29:36,260 --> 03:29:36,940
Perfect route.

3442
03:29:50,230 --> 03:29:50,810
You die.

3443
03:29:57,570 --> 03:29:58,310
Okay, where do I go?

3444
03:29:59,490 --> 03:29:59,910
Just down.

3445
03:30:02,250 --> 03:30:03,970
Like, is this technically the underworld?

3446
03:30:04,190 --> 03:30:04,990
It's like the question, right?

3447
03:30:07,010 --> 03:30:07,810
I don't think it is.

3448
03:30:07,910 --> 03:30:08,230
Like this?

3449
03:30:08,850 --> 03:30:08,970
No.

3450
03:30:09,710 --> 03:30:15,370
I think when you see the background with the little cave in the distance, that's the...

3451
03:30:15,370 --> 03:30:16,030
Oh, wait a minute.

3452
03:30:17,330 --> 03:30:18,370
What does that look like that?

3453
03:30:22,180 --> 03:30:24,080
There's a weird texture in the background.

3454
03:30:27,890 --> 03:30:28,270
What's up, dudes?

3455
03:30:37,560 --> 03:30:38,400
Wait, I have...

3456
03:30:39,300 --> 03:30:40,820
No, I was about to say I've been here, but I haven't.

3457
03:30:43,440 --> 03:30:44,060
That's scary.

3458
03:30:44,240 --> 03:30:45,460
Let's not venture down there.

3459
03:30:47,380 --> 03:30:48,560
We make our own path.

3460
03:30:55,240 --> 03:30:56,040
Ash block.

3461
03:30:58,120 --> 03:31:01,640
Dude, for a second I thought this was the tortured soul, but it's just my pig companion.

3462
03:31:03,420 --> 03:31:03,780
Damn you!

3463
03:31:17,000 --> 03:31:17,440
Okay.

3464
03:31:18,800 --> 03:31:21,220
So I am right now, all the way to the left.

3465
03:31:23,960 --> 03:31:26,320
I'm going to systematically check every one of these buildings now.

3466
03:31:28,600 --> 03:31:34,080
Because I think, for me, that's probably the most likely place that person would be.

3467
03:31:35,560 --> 03:31:37,060
Think about a tortured soul.

3468
03:31:38,040 --> 03:31:39,580
Who would torture someone down here?

3469
03:31:40,440 --> 03:31:41,740
The inhabitants of this place.

3470
03:31:41,900 --> 03:31:43,440
Where do the inhabitants live here, right?

3471
03:31:44,220 --> 03:31:46,980
Maybe there's like a little prison chamber or something.

3472
03:31:48,100 --> 03:31:49,640
Where the guy is being held.

3473
03:31:56,250 --> 03:31:57,510
I'm not seeing anything.

3474
03:31:58,850 --> 03:32:00,070
This is a big complex, though.

3475
03:32:07,450 --> 03:32:07,970
What about here?

3476
03:32:11,500 --> 03:32:12,960
Checking absolutely everything.

3477
03:32:16,530 --> 03:32:17,390
Leave him alive.

3478
03:32:29,640 --> 03:32:33,340
My guess is it's an NPC that can appear in my town.

3479
03:32:34,560 --> 03:32:38,180
When I finally cure him of his torture or rescue him.

3480
03:32:38,820 --> 03:32:39,460
No, pure him.

3481
03:32:40,480 --> 03:32:41,260
Purify him.

3482
03:32:42,160 --> 03:32:42,640
Purification powder.

3483
03:32:45,800 --> 03:32:46,920
Come here.

3484
03:32:48,120 --> 03:32:48,680
There you go.

3485
03:32:55,400 --> 03:32:56,360
Okay, let's check here now.

3486
03:33:08,280 --> 03:33:13,080
I also feel like I would have seen this tortured soul before I beat the wall of flesh.

3487
03:33:13,080 --> 03:33:14,720
Because I checked all these buildings, remember?

3488
03:33:17,380 --> 03:33:18,300
Wait, Titan Potion?

3489
03:33:24,530 --> 03:33:25,430
What does that do?

3490
03:33:26,430 --> 03:33:27,190
Knockbag increase.

3491
03:33:28,050 --> 03:33:28,070
Right.

3492
03:33:35,860 --> 03:33:36,380
How about here?

3493
03:33:38,620 --> 03:33:38,740
Oh!

3494
03:33:39,920 --> 03:33:40,640
Tortured soul!

3495
03:33:41,520 --> 03:33:42,560
There it is!

3496
03:33:42,900 --> 03:33:43,560
That was right!

3497
03:33:44,620 --> 03:33:45,620
All right, get the powder.

3498
03:33:48,260 --> 03:33:49,480
P-p-p-p-p-p-powder.

3499
03:33:51,300 --> 03:33:52,560
There it is, dude.

3500
03:34:00,340 --> 03:34:02,820
He's probably an enemy right now, yeah, he definitely is.

3501
03:34:08,400 --> 03:34:10,020
I just came from Isix!

3502
03:34:10,720 --> 03:34:12,460
He wanted...

3503
03:34:12,460 --> 03:34:13,840
I'm talking to Chester!

3504
03:34:14,920 --> 03:34:16,620
Two barrels of molasses plus!

3505
03:34:17,440 --> 03:34:19,640
Oh, never mind that, you're here.

3506
03:34:19,920 --> 03:34:20,400
Here's your money.

3507
03:34:21,460 --> 03:34:21,580
What?

3508
03:34:23,880 --> 03:34:24,440
You again?

3509
03:34:25,300 --> 03:34:29,500
I just grabbed some of my coin just moments ago, so bugger off and come back later.

3510
03:34:30,820 --> 03:34:31,340
What?

3511
03:34:35,170 --> 03:34:36,590
The fuck are you talking about?

3512
03:34:39,710 --> 03:34:41,950
Did I just get some money or what?

3513
03:34:44,590 --> 03:34:47,790
Must everyone open and shut doors so incredibly noisily around here?

3514
03:34:49,750 --> 03:34:52,270
I just gave you half a crown five minutes ago.

3515
03:34:52,610 --> 03:34:52,750
Scram!

3516
03:34:55,310 --> 03:34:55,830
Uh...

3517
03:34:55,830 --> 03:34:56,590
Wait, half a crown?

3518
03:34:57,210 --> 03:34:59,430
Are you Danish by any chance, Chester?

3519
03:35:01,990 --> 03:35:02,790
You again?

3520
03:35:03,090 --> 03:35:06,590
Suppose you want more mo- Okay, so he's gonna probably appear in my town.

3521
03:35:07,430 --> 03:35:07,610
Right?

3522
03:35:09,110 --> 03:35:10,010
Look at that demon.

3523
03:35:14,220 --> 03:35:15,060
Look at that demon.

3524
03:35:17,640 --> 03:35:18,300
What's up demon?

3525
03:35:19,560 --> 03:35:20,200
Alright, it's time.

3526
03:35:20,780 --> 03:35:21,200
We head back.

3527
03:35:22,580 --> 03:35:24,080
Alright Chester, show your face.

3528
03:35:28,760 --> 03:35:29,040
Yeah!

3529
03:35:29,280 --> 03:35:30,420
The tax collector!

3530
03:35:32,500 --> 03:35:33,020
Uh-huh.

3531
03:35:33,020 --> 03:35:38,520
Tried to get Nissa to pay me with favors once.

3532
03:35:39,320 --> 03:35:41,180
Now I have fungus growing in strange places.

3533
03:35:43,540 --> 03:35:44,080
Alright dude!

3534
03:35:45,180 --> 03:35:45,460
Alright!

3535
03:35:46,940 --> 03:35:47,660
What the fuck?

3536
03:35:50,620 --> 03:35:57,460
We should cut out the taxes that I've taken from our surplus population- Okay.

3537
03:35:58,620 --> 03:35:58,980
Chester's dead.

3538
03:36:00,260 --> 03:36:00,660
Fucking hell.

3539
03:36:01,920 --> 03:36:06,700
Well, at least I got to extract the money from him before he kicked the old bucket.

3540
03:36:07,900 --> 03:36:08,640
That's something.

3541
03:36:11,540 --> 03:36:12,220
Alright, cool.

3542
03:36:13,260 --> 03:36:15,860
Another member joins the population and now I get to tax people.

3543
03:36:16,060 --> 03:36:16,940
This is getting better and better.

3544
03:36:20,590 --> 03:36:21,510
Fill up the chests.

3545
03:36:30,120 --> 03:36:31,800
By the way, uh...

3546
03:36:31,800 --> 03:36:32,000
Isa?

3547
03:36:32,340 --> 03:36:32,580
Nissa?

3548
03:36:33,140 --> 03:36:34,700
He's talking about Rosalva there.

3549
03:36:35,100 --> 03:36:35,640
The Dryad.

3550
03:36:36,600 --> 03:36:38,760
Because the Dryad right now is called Nissa.

3551
03:36:40,200 --> 03:36:40,980
So yeah.

3552
03:36:41,860 --> 03:36:43,580
For those that don't know.

3553
03:36:45,320 --> 03:36:46,580
Uh, remove this.

3554
03:36:47,300 --> 03:36:48,020
Nobody wants you.

3555
03:36:48,760 --> 03:36:48,940
Silt!

3556
03:36:50,760 --> 03:36:51,360
Silt!

3557
03:36:55,130 --> 03:36:55,690
Okay.

3558
03:36:56,310 --> 03:36:57,970
Alright, Mr. Brock.

3559
03:37:00,650 --> 03:37:01,750
Brock the Haven.

3560
03:37:02,670 --> 03:37:03,770
What do I do next?

3561
03:37:05,770 --> 03:37:10,390
Uh, I've heard of glowing mushrooms growing big enough on the surface to ga- okay.

3562
03:37:11,350 --> 03:37:18,110
Let's try and find a glowing mushroom on the surface trying to gain sentience.

3563
03:37:19,310 --> 03:37:21,550
I'm looking for that right fucking now.

3564
03:37:22,570 --> 03:37:23,610
We're going to the right.

3565
03:37:29,390 --> 03:37:32,450
I hate that I can't use this house anymore because of this goddamn crimson.

3566
03:37:33,190 --> 03:37:34,970
And I have no idea how to get rid of it.

3567
03:37:36,870 --> 03:37:38,310
And purification powder is a joke.

3568
03:37:45,680 --> 03:37:48,240
