4401
04:27:46,820 --> 04:27:47,340
Uh...

4402
04:27:47,340 --> 04:27:49,660
I think maybe it would say something here, right?

4403
04:27:50,360 --> 04:27:51,000
If it did.

4404
04:27:53,140 --> 04:27:54,080
Uh, hold on.

4405
04:27:54,920 --> 04:27:55,540
Can I actually...

4406
04:27:57,220 --> 04:27:57,840
