4410
04:28:05,160 --> 04:28:05,860
21 melee damage.

4411
04:28:07,460 --> 04:28:09,140
100% axe power, 600 hammer power?

4412
04:28:09,300 --> 04:28:09,700
What if I...

4413
04:28:12,630 --> 04:28:17,170
Yeah, maybe it wouldn't factor into this calculation here, because it's just going to penetrate through armor.

4414
04:28:18,550 --> 04:28:18,850
You know?

4415
04:28:19,910 --> 04:28:21,390
Maybe it wouldn't show here, actually.

4416
04:28:23,830 --> 04:28:28,790
However, when you get a damage buff, it actually does increase the number you see on this tooltip.

4417
04:28:31,030 --> 04:28:32,550
So that's why I was expecting that.

4418
04:28:32,750 --> 04:28:35,470
But maybe that doesn't count for some reason, because it's...

4419
04:28:36,490 --> 04:28:37,210
an axe?

4420
04:28:37,670 --> 04:28:38,110
I don't know.

4421
04:28:38,950 --> 04:28:39,090
Maybe.

4422
04:28:40,110 --> 04:28:40,290
Ayo!

4423
04:28:41,090 --> 04:28:41,210
Isaac!

4424
04:28:41,890 --> 04:28:42,610
What else do we sell?

4425
04:28:45,190 --> 04:28:46,710
Just the basics of basics.

4426
04:28:48,910 --> 04:28:49,690
A drumstick.

4427
04:28:50,470 --> 04:28:51,570
Playable next to a drumset?

4428
04:28:53,570 --> 04:28:54,270
You know what?

4429
04:28:54,270 --> 04:28:54,990
Why not?

4430
04:28:55,550 --> 04:28:56,350
Let's try it.

4431
04:29:00,970 --> 04:29:01,410
No enemies?

4432
04:29:01,650 --> 04:29:02,490
This is the perfect time.

4433
04:29:07,480 --> 04:29:08,520
Maybe I have to have it equipped?

4434
04:29:10,960 --> 04:29:10,980
Look.

4435
04:29:20,770 --> 04:29:21,550
Oh, cool.

4436
04:29:22,290 --> 04:29:23,070
So I guess all...

4437
04:29:23,070 --> 04:29:23,250
Snare?

4438
04:29:23,530 --> 04:29:25,310
I guess all these are like musical terms.

4439
04:29:25,510 --> 04:29:26,650
I actually don't know anything about music.

4440
04:29:26,770 --> 04:29:27,450
I know what's snare.

4441
04:29:27,830 --> 04:29:28,630
I've heard that before.

4442
04:29:29,730 --> 04:29:30,090
Floor tom?

4443
04:29:30,770 --> 04:29:32,630
These are probably like...

4444
04:29:32,630 --> 04:29:33,350
drumming terms.

4445
04:29:34,390 --> 04:29:34,430
Yeah.

4446
04:29:39,930 --> 04:29:41,170
I wonder if I can do the...

4447
04:29:42,390 --> 04:29:45,890
you know, two cymbals and a snare, or whatever it's called.

4448
04:29:56,380 --> 04:29:56,780
Where's

4449
04:30:00,170 --> 04:30:00,570
the...

4450
04:30:00,570 --> 04:30:01,110
I don't know.

4451
04:30:01,850 --> 04:30:03,330
Alright, that's kind of cool, I guess.

4452
04:30:03,470 --> 04:30:05,070
Also, I guess a multiplayer item thingy.

4453
04:30:05,970 --> 04:30:09,610
It wouldn't surprise me if some people out there actually play some music with this.

4454
04:30:10,210 --> 04:30:12,370
You know, it seems possible to create a song with it.

4455
04:30:12,690 --> 04:30:13,990
I mean, you have different...

4456
04:30:14,650 --> 04:30:15,430
things you...

4457
04:30:15,910 --> 04:30:16,110
Quack!

4458
04:30:17,710 --> 04:30:19,530
You have different sounds you can make, right?

4459
04:30:20,070 --> 04:30:22,730
And whenever there's different sounds to be made, people make music.

4460
04:30:23,670 --> 04:30:24,230
That's a fact.

4461
04:30:26,030 --> 04:30:26,370
Blueberries.

4462
04:30:32,140 --> 04:30:32,640
Quackies?

4463
04:30:34,620 --> 04:30:35,680
You get to die.

4464
04:30:37,520 --> 04:30:38,880
This right here is so weird.

4465
04:30:39,480 --> 04:30:40,200
What is making that sound?

4466
04:30:42,380 --> 04:30:42,880
Septimus.

4467
04:30:46,060 --> 04:30:49,580
You can't see my face right now, but it's actually a face of rage.

4468
04:30:50,540 --> 04:30:52,780
I am filled with hatred when I look at this guy.

4469
04:30:53,620 --> 04:30:54,360
There we go.

4470
04:30:55,000 --> 04:30:55,420
Trap him in there.

4471
04:30:56,500 --> 04:30:57,580
You are not to go in the water.

4472
04:30:59,320 --> 04:30:59,880
Okay, Isaac.

4473
04:31:00,140 --> 04:31:01,820
Good thing you closed the door behind you.

4474
04:31:02,980 --> 04:31:04,040
Don't let him out of there.

4475
04:31:04,400 --> 04:31:05,200
Don't let him into the water.

4476
04:31:06,000 --> 04:31:06,280
No!

4477
04:31:07,700 --> 04:31:08,100
Motherfucker!

4478
04:31:11,350 --> 04:31:11,750
Isaac!

4479
04:31:17,790 --> 04:31:18,770
I hate that sound.

4480
04:31:20,410 --> 04:31:21,830
Okay, any mushrooms over here?

4481
04:31:22,010 --> 04:31:23,330
I was looking for mushrooms, right?

4482
04:31:29,880 --> 04:31:30,960
Here's what I'm gonna do now.

4483
04:31:33,420 --> 04:31:38,600
As an act, as a symbolic act of my frustration of finding this mushroom.

4484
04:31:41,280 --> 04:31:43,020
The Elder Slime has left.

4485
04:31:43,440 --> 04:31:43,640
Nice!

4486
04:31:44,420 --> 04:31:46,000
That just increased my spirits.

4487
04:31:47,340 --> 04:31:48,440
I'm in a better mood already.

4488
04:31:50,180 --> 04:31:50,720
A squid.

4489
04:31:51,980 --> 04:31:53,820
Oh, wait.

4490
04:31:54,680 --> 04:31:55,400
It gave me black ink.

4491
04:31:58,060 --> 04:31:58,420
Cool.

4492
04:31:59,200 --> 04:32:00,520
I'm gonna walk out into the sea.

4493
04:32:02,320 --> 04:32:03,760
With the musics blasting.

4494
04:32:10,130 --> 04:32:10,930
Wait, what do we have here?

4495
04:32:14,580 --> 04:32:15,160
Hold on now.

4496
04:32:15,280 --> 04:32:15,560
Wait a minute.

4497
04:32:15,640 --> 04:32:16,620
I was about to kill myself.

4498
04:32:17,640 --> 04:32:18,380
But now I'm intrigued.

4499
04:32:21,240 --> 04:32:22,040
What is this?

4500
04:32:36,490 --> 04:32:37,590
Would you look at that?

4501
04:32:56,350 --> 04:32:56,710
Weird!

4502
04:32:59,790 --> 04:33:00,470
Cool, though.

4503
04:33:02,530 --> 04:33:04,630
Man, this is not being held together by much, huh?

4504
04:33:05,430 --> 04:33:06,150
Drain it!

4505
04:33:08,470 --> 04:33:13,450
Oh, if you're ever in doubt whether or not to drain, the answer is always yes.

4506
04:33:14,430 --> 04:33:14,770
Drain it.

4507
04:33:15,390 --> 04:33:15,750
A chest!

4508
04:33:16,490 --> 04:33:17,070
A shark!

4509
04:33:20,430 --> 04:33:21,890
I can't think, just take things.

4510
04:33:22,830 --> 04:33:24,070
Ah, fuck, I don't have time.

4511
04:33:27,980 --> 04:33:29,080
Ah, get up, get up, get up.

4512
04:33:30,240 --> 04:33:31,040
Get up!

4513
04:33:35,460 --> 04:33:36,260
Another chest.

4514
04:33:37,620 --> 04:33:40,260
Ah, let, ah...

4515
04:33:41,260 --> 04:33:42,720
Armored water walking...

4516
04:33:42,720 --> 04:33:43,040
Whoa!

4517
04:33:45,810 --> 04:33:47,270
I think I had one of those before.

4518
04:34:05,830 --> 04:34:06,370
Um...

4519
04:34:06,370 --> 04:34:06,790
Okay.

4520
04:34:08,210 --> 04:34:09,070
That was fun.

4521
04:34:09,470 --> 04:34:11,770
Having this little inlet there, or whatever you call it.

4522
04:34:13,030 --> 04:34:14,290
I am gonna kill myself, though.

4523
04:34:19,740 --> 04:34:26,960
As a symbolic gesture of my inability to find mushrooms on the surface that was very clearly promised to me.

4524
04:34:27,740 --> 04:34:29,100
A shark fin I got.

4525
04:34:32,370 --> 04:34:32,590
Suffer.

4526
04:34:43,700 --> 04:34:44,960
Because I'm gonna call it here anyway.

4527
04:34:45,480 --> 04:34:48,100
I'm gonna teleport back to the main island now.

4528
04:34:49,160 --> 04:34:51,160
Well, the spawn point, I guess.

4529
04:34:54,930 --> 04:34:56,870
I'm developing a headache, honestly.

4530
04:35:01,780 --> 04:35:03,080
Wait, why did I drop gold?

4531
04:35:04,360 --> 04:35:06,020
I put it all in my thingy.

4532
04:35:06,280 --> 04:35:06,720
Did I not?

4533
04:35:08,020 --> 04:35:09,680
Well, I dropped 12 silver, who cares.

4534
04:35:20,970 --> 04:35:21,310
Whew!

4535
04:35:21,870 --> 04:35:22,830
I think I need to take a pill.

4536
04:35:25,790 --> 04:35:26,490
That was something.

4537
04:35:39,160 --> 04:35:40,240
Okay, I'm gonna open chat.

4538
04:35:41,820 --> 04:35:43,260
Uh, wait a minute, let me...

4539
04:35:44,980 --> 04:35:46,100
Let me do this in a smart way.

4540
04:35:57,580 --> 04:35:58,260
Yeah, that's fine.

4541
04:35:58,920 --> 04:36:00,140
Alright, I can see you now.

4542
04:36:00,880 --> 04:36:01,300
What's up, people?

4543
04:36:07,460 --> 04:36:10,400
Oliver, a big Terraria YouTuber was in here asking about your progress.

4544
04:36:11,200 --> 04:36:11,580
Oh, yeah?

4545
04:36:12,620 --> 04:36:13,420
What'd you tell him?

4546
04:36:22,540 --> 04:36:23,340
I'm struggling.

4547
04:36:33,650 --> 04:36:34,630
Nice work on the pirate invasion.

4548
04:36:34,950 --> 04:36:36,550
I feel like that's the only nice work I did today.

4549
04:36:36,770 --> 04:36:39,210
I honestly, I'm pretty aimless right now in this game.

4550
04:36:42,250 --> 04:36:43,650
I feel like, uh...

4551
04:36:44,490 --> 04:36:45,870
Expert Terraria seems ambitious.

4552
04:36:46,150 --> 04:36:47,190
Yeah, I think I agree.

4553
04:36:49,770 --> 04:36:51,070
I should not have picked expert.

4554
04:36:51,390 --> 04:36:52,870
I kinda regret it.

4555
04:36:58,020 --> 04:37:01,680
So I don't know what the next step is in the game, but I can theorize, right?

4556
04:37:02,480 --> 04:37:10,040
So far, my impressions are that most of the progression in this game is tied to the bosses.

4557
04:37:11,780 --> 04:37:20,480
And it's not clear at all which bosses are supposed to be fought in which order at all, because at one point you'll be fighting something that is extremely easy.

4558
04:37:21,340 --> 04:37:25,080
And next up, you just get smashed, like there's no fucking chance.

4559
04:37:25,220 --> 04:37:27,080
And you don't know how to get to the boss?

4560
04:37:27,080 --> 04:37:35,080
Like I had this item that summoned it, maybe I think I crafted it, but how are you supposed to know to make that item and in which order?

4561
04:37:36,960 --> 04:37:41,740
And for me, the bosses themselves are probably the worst thing about this game.

4562
04:37:42,340 --> 04:37:43,360
I don't like fighting them.

4563
04:37:44,160 --> 04:37:45,820
I wish I could never fight them.

4564
04:37:46,820 --> 04:37:49,360
So I feel like I... and they're so difficult too.

4565
04:37:51,020 --> 04:37:52,720
They're just not fun for me.

4566
04:37:53,860 --> 04:37:55,240
The bosses are just not fun.

4567
04:37:55,840 --> 04:37:58,740
So that's... I think that's what's preventing me from progressing.

4568
04:37:59,000 --> 04:38:00,240
That's my theory right now.

4569
04:38:06,460 --> 04:38:07,240
Expert was a mistake.

4570
04:38:07,700 --> 04:38:08,520
Yeah, yeah.

4571
04:38:10,600 --> 04:38:12,240
Now I'll be legendary if you continue.

4572
04:38:12,600 --> 04:38:13,040
Here's the thing.

4573
04:38:15,440 --> 04:38:21,660
Yeah, so I'm trying to draw parallels here now to Rainworld, because I also struggled a lot in that game, right?

4574
04:38:22,740 --> 04:38:31,460
But that game had a different kind of difficulty, where you're sort of this helpless creature in this hostile world, right?

4575
04:38:34,240 --> 04:38:40,620
And most of the time you sort of knew what the idea was, or actually, maybe you even didn't, right?

4576
04:38:40,740 --> 04:38:44,040
There were many times in some of the campaigns where you didn't know what to do.

4577
04:38:45,040 --> 04:38:53,920
But I feel like at least the surviving part and getting lore out of that was like a really nice reward.

4578
04:38:53,920 --> 04:38:54,460
You know what I mean?

4579
04:38:54,540 --> 04:38:56,180
Like, that's really motivating.

4580
04:38:57,940 --> 04:38:59,400
I don't know if I can say the same about this game.

4581
04:39:01,020 --> 04:39:01,680
Are you watching hockey?

4582
04:39:02,300 --> 04:39:03,020
No, not at all.

4583
04:39:03,660 --> 04:39:05,220
I don't know anything about hockey, bro.

4584
04:39:06,020 --> 04:39:08,300
And I'm not calling you bro, just because your name is bro.

4585
04:39:11,400 --> 04:39:12,400
What, things are fun then?

4586
04:39:12,840 --> 04:39:15,040
I really love exploring caves in this game.

4587
04:39:16,880 --> 04:39:17,240
Caving?

4588
04:39:17,240 --> 04:39:18,180
Finding new items?

4589
04:39:19,120 --> 04:39:19,280
Building?

4590
04:39:19,600 --> 04:39:20,340
I really like building.

4591
04:39:20,660 --> 04:39:21,820
You probably knew that by now.

4592
04:39:24,340 --> 04:39:29,020
But it's like constantly being interrupted by random shit, you know, like enemies everywhere.

4593
04:39:31,700 --> 04:39:33,880
Expert looked promising in the beginning, unfortunately having trouble.

4594
04:39:34,120 --> 04:39:39,020
Yeah, it's really like... I do admit, maybe I'm just really terrible at this game.

4595
04:39:39,240 --> 04:39:41,040
I mean, it's fine.

4596
04:39:41,740 --> 04:39:43,680
Maybe I just suck, you know, it's very possible.

4597
04:39:44,740 --> 04:39:46,220
I'm not an expert at all.

4598
04:39:51,320 --> 04:39:51,800
So...

4599
04:39:51,800 --> 04:39:53,800
I mean...

4600
04:39:54,900 --> 04:39:56,680
No, I wouldn't say ooh, but yeah.

4601
04:39:57,920 --> 04:39:59,240
I like some sports.

4602
04:40:00,540 --> 04:40:00,780
Esports.

4603
04:40:02,260 --> 04:40:03,060
Haha, Starcraft.

4604
04:40:04,760 --> 04:40:06,360
Didn't know you're an excellent drummer, boy.

4605
04:40:07,360 --> 04:40:09,440
I'm not Diego, I don't know anything about drums.

4606
04:40:10,000 --> 04:40:11,160
I can't play any instrument.

4607
04:40:12,880 --> 04:40:14,340
Unfortunately, I have a blow-high.

4608
04:40:15,600 --> 04:40:16,500
The all-one.

4609
04:40:18,000 --> 04:40:18,480
Nice.

4610
04:40:18,800 --> 04:40:19,900
I was thinking of getting one myself.

4611
04:40:19,900 --> 04:40:24,800
I have a friend who keeps talking about it, and she's very adamant about the blow-high.

4612
04:40:26,540 --> 04:40:28,380
Wait, where are you from, the all-one?

4613
04:40:32,190 --> 04:40:35,350
Expert can be really hard, especially if you don't have a great idea on the progression of the game.

4614
04:40:35,830 --> 04:40:36,410
Yeah, so here's the thing.

4615
04:40:36,510 --> 04:40:46,490
I already knew going in, because people told me this, that this game is heavily reliant on the player looking up things on a V-key, right?

4616
04:40:47,790 --> 04:40:48,470
Here's the thing.

4617
04:40:48,730 --> 04:40:53,850
I didn't go into this game with an adamant mindset of I don't want to use the wiki at all.

4618
04:40:54,910 --> 04:40:56,490
That's not how I approach things.

4619
04:40:56,810 --> 04:40:59,230
Honestly, for me, it's just like I see this game on Steam.

4620
04:41:00,150 --> 04:41:00,910
It's a video game.

4621
04:41:01,650 --> 04:41:03,370
I want to play the video game, right?

4622
04:41:04,150 --> 04:41:06,990
And I just want to play it as it is, you know?

4623
04:41:07,910 --> 04:41:14,670
I feel it's kind of silly if I have to use external tools to try to understand the game I'm playing.

4624
04:41:16,410 --> 04:41:18,190
So that's like the mindset that I have.

4625
04:41:18,750 --> 04:41:23,830
I would never be against using the wiki at all times or something, you know?

4626
04:41:23,890 --> 04:41:27,430
If a game is actually made for that and if you cannot play it without it.

4627
04:41:27,790 --> 04:41:30,030
Well, of course, in that case, you have to do it, right?

4628
04:41:31,790 --> 04:41:34,270
It's 100% possible to beat the game without the wiki.

4629
04:41:34,690 --> 04:41:35,950
Yeah, I guess it is.

4630
04:41:37,850 --> 04:41:39,270
I mean, I imagine it is.

4631
04:41:40,750 --> 04:41:43,570
And my guess is I just have to beat all the bosses, right?

4632
04:41:44,690 --> 04:41:46,350
That's my guess on that.

4633
04:41:48,370 --> 04:41:49,650
You beat the game without the wiki?

4634
04:41:50,150 --> 04:41:51,010
That's nice, man.

4635
04:41:51,950 --> 04:41:53,090
But did you also enjoy the bosses?

4636
04:42:00,420 --> 04:42:03,460
Because I think it's a bit easier, maybe, like motivationally.

4637
04:42:08,400 --> 04:42:10,220
Expert just requires more knowledge of the game.

4638
04:42:10,980 --> 04:42:11,340
Huh.

4639
04:42:12,160 --> 04:42:14,700
Do you mean like, what type of knowledge are you talking about?

4640
04:42:14,820 --> 04:42:15,980
Do you mean like, what to do next?

4641
04:42:17,260 --> 04:42:21,140
Or is it more like knowledge as in more experience and more skill?

4642
04:42:22,120 --> 04:42:23,520
Knowing how to fight.

4643
04:42:24,340 --> 04:42:24,780
Is that what you mean?

4644
04:42:26,080 --> 04:42:27,140
